0 Triad Table — three-leg planar positioning platform
0 Name: triad-table.ldr
0 Author: CrispStrobe
0 !LICENSE BSD-3-Clause : see ../licenses/triad-table.txt
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // One SPIKE Prime hub; three real motor-driven R-P-R legs, A/B/C.
0 // Home actuator pin lengths 140 LDU; common leg plane Y=0.
0 // Three retained endpoint hinges carry one rigid passive platform.
0 // No hidden joints, fixed chassis bodies or prescribed platform trajectory.
